{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/7707","id":4929454208,"node_id":"PR_kwDOELj1_s8AAAABJdGAgA","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/pull/7707","diff_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/pull/7707.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/pull/7707.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/7707","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/7707/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/7707/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/7707/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/statuses/dfbab49f4f2e9282c2256c8862545618a3746a9e","number":7707,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"fix(server): preserve stack and name of cross-realm error causes","user":{"login":"KATT","id":459267,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTI2Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/459267?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT","html_url":"https://github.com/KATT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nConfidence: high — small, targeted change; the regression test reproduces the bug and now passes; all error-related suites and full CI are green, with no behaviour change for plain objects or native errors.\n\nFixes #6977\n\n## Root cause\n\nErrors created in another realm (`node:vm`, iframes, some bundler/APM sandboxes) fail `instanceof Error`, so `getCauseFromUnknown` wraps them in `UnknownCauseError`. That wrapper copied fields with `Object.assign`, which only copies own enumerable properties. It skips the non-enumerable own `stack` and the `name` inherited from the prototype. On top of that, `getTRPCErrorFromUnknown` only inherited the cause's stack when `cause instanceof Error`. The result: `onError` reported `cause.name === 'Error'` and a stack starting inside tRPC instead of the original frames.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Add an `isErrorLike` type guard: `instanceof Error` or `Object.prototype.toString.call(value) === '[object Error]'`. Unlike `util.types.isNativeError`, it works cross-realm and in every runtime.\n- In `UnknownCauseError`, after `Object.assign`, explicitly copy `name` and `stack` (when they are strings) for error-like causes.\n- In `getTRPCErrorFromUnknown`, inherit the stack when the cause is error-like, not only when it's `instanceof Error`.\n\nPlain thrown objects still fail the brand check and keep their own fields exactly as before. Normal `Error` causes are untouched (still returned as-is).\n\n## Test evidence\n\n- `packages/tests/server/regression/issue-6977-cross-realm-error-cause.test.ts`: failed before (all 4 assertions on `cause.name`, `cause.stack` and `error.stack`), passes now.\n- Error-related suites (19 files, 277 tests) pass: `TRPCError`, `errors`, `errorFormatting`, `procedureErrors` (server and client), regressions 3351, 4217 and 7272, and every test touching `onError` or `getTRPCErrorFromUnknown`.\n- `tsc` for `@trpc/server` and `@trpc/tests`, prettier and eslint are clean.\n- CI: all checks green, including E2E for Bun, Deno, Cloudflare Workers, Vercel Edge, and Node 20/22.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-9cf4eb23-1980-4dc1-bd36-ff50b58f3334?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-9cf4eb23-1980-4dc1-bd36-ff50b58f3334&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/trpc/codesmith/trpc/pr/7707?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795049796&installation_model_id=443568&pr_number=7707&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=trpc%2Ftrpc&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ftrpc%2Ftrpc%2Fpull%2F7707&signature=7bd9fc500f262991d729d1a187d019b974c750951a4dd9612d1241b2744d5d34\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved error handling for errors originating outside the current execution context.\n  * Preserved the original error name and stack details when reporting these failures.\n  * Ensured affected procedure errors continue to surface as `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` responses.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Added coverage for cross-context `TypeError` handling and error reporting.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:56:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:07:17Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T08:05:02Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T08:05:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"a8e7dcc5e7daef5bdd8b3a0bd065f4932f40e4a6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"trpc:cursor/issue-6977-cross-realm-error-cause-3334","ref":"cursor/issue-6977-cross-realm-error-cause-3334","repo":{"id":280557054,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyODA1NTcwNTQ=","name":"trpc","full_name":"trpc/trpc","owner":{"login":"trpc","id":78011399,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc4MDExMzk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78011399?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trpc","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trpc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trpc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trpc/gists{/gist_id}","